# Normalize line endings. Text files are stored with LF in the repo and
# checked out with LF on every platform, which matches the Biome formatter.
# Git auto-detects binary files and leaves their bytes untouched.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Be explicit about common binary assets so their bytes are never altered.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.icns binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
